 margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/magicuntrap.gif\" width=\"44\">Magic \n                                        Untrap</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">An \n                                        Jux &nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간 \n                                        : 즉시</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Sulphurous Ash, Blood Moss</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Magic Untrap는 매직트렙이 걸려있는 \n                                        상자의 트랩헤제를 합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">실제적으로 \n                                        보물상자등의 트랩은 해당 마법을 쓰지 \n                                        않고 4써클 텔레크니스를 이용합니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:20; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">\n<fon